## Notice

- **Author / 作者**: FlyDragon39
- **Project / 项目**: dsh-verify — an external completeness verifier for
  DeepSeek Harness plugins and agent-preset modes.

### Upstream 上游

This project is built against **DSH (official edition) `0.2.0-rc.2`**. That is
the version all behaviour, file formats and compatibility claims were tested
against. Compatibility with later DSH versions has **not** been tested and is
not guaranteed; a DSH update may change composition layers, preset discovery or
artifact shapes, and this tool must be re-validated against it.

本项目以上游 **DSH（官方版）`0.2.0-rc.2`** 为基准构建，全部行为、文件格式与兼容性结论都
基于该版本实测。**后续版本的兼容性尚未测试**，也不作保证；DSH 升级可能改变配置层、
preset 发现方式或产出物形态，届时需要重新校验本工具。

### How this was made 项目说明

This is a personal project completed with AI assistance, and it is the author's
first attempt at building and submitting code. Shortcomings are likely — issues,
corrections and suggestions are very welcome.

本项目是作者在 AI 协助下完成的个人项目，也是作者首次尝试代码构建与提交，难免有不足
之处，欢迎提出 issue、指正与建议。

### Open source 开源声明

This project is **fully open source**: commercial use and modification are not
restricted, and it may be used freely. The only requirement is that the
original author and this project are credited.

本项目**完全开源**：不限制商用与修改，可自由使用；唯一要求是标注原作者与项目名称。
